{"seq":3,"slug":"personalization-balance","title":"个性化与多样性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-result-diversity-dedup/personalization-balance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"filter-bubble-mitigate","title":"信息茧房缓解与探索位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-result-diversity-dedup/personalization-balance/filter-bubble-mitigate","wordCount":3263,"readingTime":14},{"seq":2,"slug":"query-dependent-diversity","title":"按查询意图调多样强度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-result-diversity-dedup/personalization-balance/query-dependent-diversity","wordCount":2798,"readingTime":12},{"seq":3,"slug":"diversity-exploit-explore","title":"利用与探索平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-result-diversity-dedup/personalization-balance/diversity-exploit-explore","wordCount":2851,"readingTime":12}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"个性化与多样性\">个性化与多样性</h1><p>越精准越窄。</p>\n<p>第二章讲的是同一个列表对所有人一视同仁时的打散。一旦系统开始按用户画像调整个性化强度，一个新的问题就出现了：<strong>个性化与多样性在方向上是相反的</strong>。个性化把排序推向用户已知的偏好，多样性把排序推离它；两个目标都正确，但它们的冲突必须被显式管理，而不是靠调权重「希望」它们共存。</p>\n<p>第一篇讲冲突的极端形态：信息茧房。它不是模型的 bug，而是反馈闭环 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t \\to y_t \\to \\hat\\theta_{t+1} \\to p_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1662em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的稳态——因为用户只能点击被展示的东西，系统在未被探索的维度上永远停在先验值，视野被缓慢收窄。这一篇给出四个可从日志观测的代理指标、三类打破闭环的力量，以及探索位这个具体机制的工程实现：插什么、怎么计量、以及为什么它的验收指标应该是信息产量而不是点击率。</p>\n<p>第二篇讲多样强度应该由谁决定。答案是<strong>查询本身</strong>：用户搜具体型号时要的是报价而非铺开的品类，搜类目词时要的是可比选项。这一篇给出四类意图信号（词典规则、形态特征、历史点击熵、Query2Vec 近邻）与它们的级联用法，给出档位到参数的映射表，并讲清两个边界——精确意图是「打散关、去重开」，档位切换要加滞回与会话锁定。</p>\n<p>第三篇讲探索的正规形式。搜索里的探索是「用一次曝光买一条信息」，它的标准框架是上下文老虎机，而与标准老虎机有三处结构性差异需要在工程上修正：候选每轮变化、收益有位置偏差（须用 IPS）、会话内样本相关。这一篇还给出一个可落地的三段式近似，以及探索的验收为什么必须与利用分表看。</p>\n<p>三篇的关系是<strong>问题 → 参数 → 算法</strong>的递进：第一篇确立「茧房是闭环稳态」这个诊断，第二篇把多样强度交给查询意图来定，第三篇把最难的探索决策交给带理论保证的算法框架。它们共同回答同一个问题：<strong>个性化与多样性各自该在什么位置让步</strong>。</p>\n<p>本章在 hub 中的位置是<strong>平衡层</strong>。它夹在第二章（确定的打散算法）与第四章（可配置的运营）之间：第二章给出的打散参数在这里被个性化信号与意图档位调制，调制后的取值再进入第四章的配置表。这一章也是全 hub 与商业长期目标耦合最紧的一章——它的收益以季度计，代价以点击率计，这正是第四章实验设计必须特殊处理的根源。</p>\n<p>一句边界声明：本章讨论的是策略平衡，不涉及个性化的数据合规设计（最小化采集、端侧处理、可解释控制属于相邻 hub 的主题）。前置知识上，需要读者了解基本的概率分布、期望与方差，以及 A/B 实验的基本概念；上下文老虎机的推导不在本章展开，本章只讲它在搜索场景中的适配要点。</p>\n"}